  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_e5236de21aeb431dbc1239a8afab7991",
      "statement": "The Embedder interface in mcp-server/src/indexing/embed.ts defines the embedding abstraction as three readonly/instance members: `model` (string), `dims` (number), and `embed(texts: string[]): Promise<number[][]>`. The rest of the server depends only on this interface, not on any vendor SDK.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/indexing/embed.ts#L4-L8",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5880466483ef11ef7b8634f5ed1a3e2fb1d8eaeb26919ae77809fd09543618ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1bc686d9be81400b8c07dd5848592b82",
      "statement": "Provider selection is config-driven via EMBEDDING_PROVIDER, a zod enum restricted to \"openai\" or \"gemini\" defaulting to \"openai\". config.ts validates that the matching API key is present (OPENAI_API_KEY for openai, GEMINI_API_KEY for gemini) and exits with a non-zero status if the required key is missing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/config.ts#L27-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:66a98b13afae6d5d263c5a11dede71518a8307082102114a54d0ec77ce68fe73:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/config.ts#L9-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b0d0ae25095aa35aee6236f1d6f549c570faa7b129a098ae73e4e04749bdbcb3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1d67be4730524a46b643240b725ce1bf",
      "statement": "createEmbedder() is the factory that maps config to a live Embedder. It returns createOpenAIEmbedder() only when EMBEDDING_PROVIDER is \"openai\"; for any other value (including \"gemini\") it throws \"not yet implemented\". Thus Gemini is accepted by config validation but has no implementation in embed.ts.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/indexing/embed.ts#L61-L65",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c3d945e4ff74b8a9436a2490bff2c04c8b9e4b7f5e30ae5e6865b58113017a8f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_edae5a44aa0b49e789dc17cef8be6eca",
      "statement": "The OpenAI embedder lazily imports the openai SDK inside its embed method (`await import(\"openai\")`) and constructs a fresh OpenAI client on each embed call, so the SDK is never loaded when a cache hit avoids embedding entirely.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/indexing/embed.ts#L40-L42",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:eda2e09327ad56546145493aa70b4d7f5b8f728c91c8c67eccddefbd1706cfdd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e3972dd6b0994459a02a437685846520",
      "statement": "The OpenAI embedder hard-codes dims to 1536 (matching text-embedding-3-small) and configures its model from OPENAI_EMBED_MODEL, which defaults to text-embedding-3-small.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/config.ts#L11-L11",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ed34c6a858068c0efbbe6246783be145930c704febd3bcb2ab67d87cbcf480f3:"
